              },
              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_NigMqB": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How much caffeine is in it?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "question_mark",
                    "image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Q.svg",
                    "width": 18
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_Aj8L3d": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Each capsule packs a 125mg caffeine punch – enough to wake your brain cells from their case of the \"Mondays\" (on a Wednesday, no doubt) but not so much that you'll be bouncing off the wall like that time you forget the double shot of espresso before your pre-workout. That was a bad day.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_Aj8L3d"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_PEHFCG": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Should I take it with food?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "question_mark",
                    "image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Q.svg",
                    "width": 18
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_kiML4k": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>For optimal results, you'll wanna take EZ-A with a light snack like those leftover saltines from the break room. Some folks get that tingly niacin feeling on an empty stomach, which isn't dangerous, but when it sneaks up on you it might be surprising.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_kiML4k"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_gCwjmJ": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Why does my skin turn red?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "question_mark",
                    "image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Q.svg",
                    "width": 18
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_9R9MM6": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Got that sudden red glow? It's just a niacin (Vitamin B) flush. Totally normal, completely harmless, and fades away in minutes. While you wait, practice your just-thinking-really-damn-hard face for maximum office intimidation.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_9R9MM6"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_TeGnDd": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Is there any sugar in it?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "question_mark",
                    "image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Q.svg",
                    "width": 18
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_tpEtL3": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Hell no. Your brain deserves better than a cheap sugar rush followed by the inevitable crash right before that awkward conversation with HR about your \"work-life balance.\"</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
